   - UnmodifiableTissueEventBase's private callback forwarding counterparts.
   - TissueEventBase.type(...) const constructor and the _fromRecord constructors — abstract/private constructors only reachable internally.

   Reaching 95% here would require either deleting those dead callback/record plumbing members or wiring them into the receptor's completion path (a framework-behavior change). I did not want to silently remove public/exported members.

